# Language navigation

Link equivalent content in the languages the service genuinely supports.

## When to use

Offer language navigation when a translated version of the current content exists. Keep the person on the same topic and preserve only state that can safely carry between versions. Do not take a translation link to an unrelated home page or automatically infer language from a person’s name.

British Sign Language requires its own content and discovery approach; see the [BSL pattern](../patterns/british-sign-language.html). A language menu is not a substitute for an accessible signed version.

